MOKAN includes and extends code from the TimeKAN project:

  TimeKAN: KAN-based Frequency Decomposition Learning Architecture for
  Long-term Time Series Forecasting

  Original authors: Songtao Huang, Zhen Zhao, Can Li, and Lei Bai
  Source: https://github.com/huangst21/TimeKAN
  Paper: https://openreview.net/forum?id=wTLc79YNbh

The original TimeKAN source is distributed under the Apache License, Version
2.0. The license text is included in LICENSE.

Files from the upstream TimeKAN implementation are retained in this
repository under data_provider/, exp/, layers/, models/TimeKAN.py, run.py,
and utils/. The MOKAN project modifies selected files and adds the MOKAN
extension under models/MOKAN.py and mokan/.
